<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman reiterates Xilinx buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman reiterates Xilinx buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Michael Gumport reiterated his buy rating on Xilinx Inc.</p>
<p>-- Noted that company's announced sales shortfall likely today to cause &quot;wide reassessment&quot; in chip stocks.</p>
<p>-- However, said would view weakness in Xilinx shares as buying opportunity and would be aggressive buyers at 28 to 30 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 2-3/8 to 31-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
